        "text": "In around June 2022, Instagram introduced a game-changing feature allowing users to pin up to three posts at the forefront of their profile feed. Unlike the typical chronological flow, these pinned posts remain fixed at the top, ensuring they capture visitors’ attention first. This dynamic feature presents a remarkable opportunity to forge connections with your audience and spotlight key facets of your brand. Join us as we delve into the nuances and growth opportunities afforded by pinning an Instagram post."
