        "text": "Design tools infused with AI capabilities assist designers in generating layouts, suggesting colour palettes, and even optimising designs based on performance metrics. This automation doesn’t replace human creativity but amplifies it by handling repetitive tasks, allowing designers to focus on innovation and ideation."
