        "text": "In today’s rapidly evolving business landscape, many established brands find themselves facing unprecedented challenges. From shifting consumer preferences to the rise of digital platforms, the reasons behind this trend are multifaceted. This blog post delves into the key factors contributing to the struggles of most brands and offers insights into how they can navigate these turbulent waters."
