        "text": "A click funnel website is a strategic online marketing tool designed to guide visitors through a series of steps, with the ultimate goal of converting them into customers. It involves a carefully crafted sequence of pages, each intended to lead the visitor towards a specific action, such as making a purchase, subscribing to a newsletter, or requesting more information."
