        "text": "One of the golden rules of design is to keep it simple. Canva offers a vast array of fonts, graphics, and elements to choose from, but resist the temptation to use them all at once. Overcomplicating your design can lead to clutter and confusion for your audience. Instead, opt for clean layouts, a limited colour palette, and minimalistic elements. Remember, less is often more when it comes to design, and simplicity ensures that your message remains clear and impactful."
